== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Book of Virtues|Book of Virtues]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Antibirth'', it had a two-room charge but was purely an active item and lacked the effect where it combines with other active items.
** Bethany used to be able to use specific types of heart pickups to create special wisps, similarly to how {{c|Tainted Eve}} can make special blood clot familiars using certain hearts.
** Wisps would not take explosive damage and the book’s wisp limit was always 16, with wisps orbiting a first ring of 8 and then a second ring of 8 when the first was full.
** In ''Community Remix'', it had a completely different effect where it functioned like {{i|Metronome}} but with a 6 room charge.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
* This item is likely a reference to the 9 virtues of a person living in accord with the Holy Spirit, mentioned in Galatians 5.<ref>https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Galatians%205&version=NIV</ref>
* This is the only book item that can still appear if Isaac is holding {{t|NO!}}, due to being considered a passive item.
* If you have {{i|Birthright}} as {{C|Judas}} and another active item, both books will be under the active item; the Book of Belial on the bottom with the Book of Virtues above it. When the active item is used, you will get the effects of both books as well.

